    "title" "Viewpoint Extraction Support"
    "description" "[h1]Viewpoint Extraction Support[/h1] Displays a UH-1B extraction helicopter in Project Viewpoint while using Extraction Mode. [h2]Features[/h2] [list][*]Shows the UH-1B during the final approach, boarding and departure stages.[*]Adds positional extraction audio in Viewpoint while preserving the original Extraction Mode and Visible Helicopter Events behavior.[*]Shows extraction areas in the 3D world, including terrain-following yellow boarding markers.[*]Keeps extraction points visible before an event is active and exposes Board Extraction Helicopter through Viewpoint when boarding is available.[*]Optionally hides the Extraction Mode HUD unless an inventory or loot window is open.[*]Optionally applies NeatUI styling to Extraction Mode menus when NeatUI_Framework is installed; the normal interface remains available through Mod Options.[/list] [h2]Requirements[/h2] [list][*]Project Zomboid Build 42.21+[*]Extraction Mode[*]Project Viewpoint[*]ZombieBuddy 2.3.4+[*]Visible Helicopter Events[*]UH-1B Helicopter[*]Aviation Core[/list] Keep Show event aircraft enabled in Visible Helicopter Events. Extraction timing, boarding rules, zombie attraction and server synchronization remain owned by Extraction Mode.

Workshop ID: 3827358939
Mod ID: ViewpointExtractionSupport"
    "changenote" "0.1.13: Add optional NeatUI menus with rounded extraction buttons."
}
